& [Necessary]
  + RSO supplies three verified selected candidates and RSP requires one packet containing all three
  + the parent validator refuses three solely because its explicit maximum is two
  + an isolated bound revision is necessary because splitting the packet would violate one-envelope correspondence and reducing the fixture would hide the integration defect

& [Sufficient]
  + changing the maximum to sixteen is sufficient because observation coordinate and projection bounds already admit sixteen activations and one coordinate
  + 8192 projected-byte enforcement remains the independent aggregate safety bound

& [NotSufficient]
  + increased declaration capacity does not establish usefulness optimality model fit delivery or execution
